          m_Value0: 0
          m_Value1: 0
        Name: 
        m_Value: "Allow me the honor of introducing perfection: Drusilla, Dracula\u2019s
          favorite daughter! And you? You\u2019re just\u2026 hmm, how do I put this?
          Oh, yes! An itsy-bitsy inconvenience."
